    {
      "game": "Gotham Knights",
      "game_image": "https://gaming-cdn.com/images/products/18033/450x258/gotham-knights-pc-game-steam-cover.jpg?v=1791410400",
      "game_url": "https://www.instant-gaming.com/en/18033-buy-gotham-knights-pc-game-steam/",
      "user": "gamer-361be64",
      "avatar": "https://gaming-cdn.com/themes/igv2/images/avatar2.svg",
      "sentiment": "dislike",
      "content": "It’s a piece of garbage, after the masterpiece that was Arkham Knight this game it’s absolutely horrendous, the detective mode its trash, no gliding and on top of that the batcycle drives horrible, not even red hood has the same abilities and movement."
